# ^ Deliberately NOT ignored in this fork. The parent ZoFHub repo is a PRIVATE
# full-machine backup ("nothing is excluded"), and DayDream refuses to start
# without it — so a fresh clone would have a built DayDream that can't run.
# The marketplace psk in it is a random local-dev value for a 127.0.0.1-bound
# service. Keep the repo private; rotate the psk if it is ever exposed.
